  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: Regency Hospital has raised Rs 110 crore from BlackSoil Capital to fund expansion and <a href=\"/tag/healthcare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">healthcare</a> infrastructure. The hospital said the <a href=\"/tag/investment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">investment</a> will fund its expansion into tier 2 and tier 3 markets where demand for specialised care continues to grow. Regency currently operates <a href=\"/tag/hospitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hospitals</a> in Kanpur, Lucknow and Gorakhpur offering care across oncology, nephrology, gastroenterology, cardiology, critical care and other specialities.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>As demand for care grows beyond metropolitan cities, BlackSoil said it expects to continue building its healthcare lending portfolio, with a focus on established operators expanding their presence across tier-2 and tier-3 markets.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                          